+# Security Fix: CVE-2026-111497
+
+**Package**: pyarrow 24.0.0
+**CVE**: CVE-2026-111497
+
+The Brotli decoder bundled by Apache Arrow C++ (v1.0.9) does not detect an
+invalid block-switch stream early enough (out-of-bounds write). The fix
+backports the upstream decoder change to Brotli v1.0.9 (`c/dec/decode.c` and
+`c/include/brotli/decode.h`).
+
+Those files are not part of the PyPI sdist (no Arrow C++ or Brotli source). The
+backport is applied during the native build from
+`build/brotli-v1.0.9-CVE-2026-111497.patch`.
